<title>USA: TABLE - 1st Bergen Bancorp Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - 1st Bergen Bancorp Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WOOD-RIDGE, N.J. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>6/30/97		     6/30/96</p>
<p> Loans receivable	    $2,593,772		  $2,378,502</p>
<p> Total Interest Income	4,946,164		   4,355,843</p>
<p>Interest Expense:</p>
<p>   Deposits		     2,325,419		   2,346,423</p>
